# A NEWS File to document package updates

CHANGES IN VERSION 2.21.2
-----------------------
MODIFICATIONS:

    * ADDIS_exhaustive now checks that lambda >= alpha * tau, as required by
      Fischer et al. (2024); this also ensures no p-value above lambda is
      rejected
    * ADDIS_exhaustive now rejects alpha = 1, lambda = tau and gamma summing
      to more than 1, which previously gave invalid results without an error
    * ADDIS now rejects lambda = tau, as required by Tian and Ramdas (2019)
    * ADDIS with async = TRUE now follows Algorithm 3 of Tian and Ramdas (2019)
      exactly. Rejection times and candidate counts were previously based on the
      order in which tests started rather than on their decision times, which
      gave different (sometimes higher) test levels when tests overlapped
    * LOND now checks that a user-supplied betai is at least as long as the
      number of p-values
    * added tests of ADDIS_exhaustive testing levels and of the async ADDIS
      candidate threshold
    * corrected errors in the documentation, vignettes and references

CHANGES IN VERSION 2.21.1
-----------------------
MODIFICATIONS:

    * added the ADDIS_exhaustive procedure and documentation
    * fixed bugs in ADDIS
    * fixed a floating-point precision issue in the LOND check on betai
    * refreshed documentation and pkgdown site for the new release
    * tidied build ignores for development-only files

CHANGES IN VERSION 2.2.0
-----------------------
MODIFICATIONS:

    * fixed bugs in LONDstar, LORDstar and SAFFRONstar
    * updated code for ADDIS


CHANGES IN VERSION 2.0.0
-----------------------
MODIFICATIONS:

    * added Rcpp code for online testing algorithms
    * added online batch algorithms of Zrnic et al. [2020]
    * added Storey-BH algorithm
    * added setBound function
    * updated vignette and pkgdown site
    * updated unit tests
    * updated references


CHANGES IN VERSION 1.8.0
-----------------------
MODIFICATIONS:

    * harmonised inputs to algorithms
    * added unit tests
    * updated authors
    

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.4.0
-----------------------
MODIFICATIONS:

    * added online FWER algorithms of Tian and Ramdas [2019b]
    * added the ADDIS algorithms of Tian and Ramdas [2019a]
    * added asynchronous online testing algorithms of Zrnic et al. [2018]
    * added the SAFFRON procedure for online FDR control [Ramdas et al., 2018]
    * added the Alpha-investing procedure of Ramdas et al. [2018]
    * updated vignette
    * deprecated LORDdep and added functionality to LORD
    * deprecated bonfInfinite, which is replaced by Alpha_spending
    * removed LORD versions 1 and 2
    * added unit tests
    * updated references
    * updated authors


CHANGES IN VERSION 1.2.0
-----------------------
MODIFICATIONS:

    * updated unit tests for LOND, LORD, bonfInfinite and LORDdep
    * added the LORD++ procedure for online FDR control [Ramdas et al., 2017]
    * updated references
    * updated vignette
    

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.0.0
-----------------------
MODIFICATIONS:

    * package added to Bioconductor
